                    "Also used to agree, as in yes, that is so"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Mba",
                    "No",
                    "Plain and not impolite"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Ee, ọ dị mma",
                    "Yes, that is fine",
                    "A softened agreement"
                  ],
                  [
