                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tip",
                "title": "Biko is not only for requests",
                "text": "Biko means please, but it is also what you say to get someone's attention politely — rather like excuse me. Opening with biko rather than launching into a question is the ordinary polite move, and it costs you one word."
              }
